## What you may do

Use this in your own real estate business, free, for as many clients as you like.

Change it. Rebrand it with your own colors, logo and wording. Add your own must-have
lists, your own market's inspection prompts, your own buyer types.

Give the scorecards you build with it to your own clients, including as part of paid
services you sell them.

Show it to other agents and point them at this repository.

## What you may not do

Do not redistribute this skill, the template, or a modified version of either, as your
own work or under your own name. Point people here instead.

Do not sell this skill or a derivative of it as a product, a template pack, a course
asset, a lead magnet, or a bonus. Selling your own real estate services, with this as one
of the tools you use, is fine and is the point.

Do not remove the credit line from `SKILL.md` or from this file.

## Credit

Keep this line wherever the skill lives:

> Showing Scorecard, built by Sarah Arlington, Rooster Homes.

Scorecards you generate for your own clients carry your branding, not hers. The credit
belongs on the skill, not on the page your buyer sees.

